@startuml
actor Student

Student -> Frontend: Submit quiz answers
Frontend -> API: POST /api/quizzes/{id}/submit
activate API

API -> Database: Validate quiz exists
Database --> API: Quiz data

API -> Database: Insert submission record
API -> Database: Insert answer records
Database --> API: Insert confirmation

API --> Frontend: 200 OK, Submission ID
Frontend --> Student: Show confirmation screen
@enduml